        <mxCell id="leg_tb" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff;strokeColor=#999;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Trust Boundaries (코드 검증 함수 기준, 2026-05-12 검증)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot;&gt;--- TB0&lt;/font&gt;: Proxy 진입점 — 자체 검증 없음 (pass-through)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#FF0000&quot;&gt;━ TB1&lt;/font&gt;: Disperser 진입 — validateDispersalRequest&lt;br&gt;    (ECDSA sig + commitment + quorum + field element)&lt;br&gt;    verifyReceivedBlobKey (클라이언트측)&lt;br&gt;    GenerateAndCompareBlobCommitment (retriever측)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#FF8C00&quot;&gt;━ TB2&lt;/font&gt;: Disperser ↔ Operator — AuthenticateStoreChunksRequest,&lt;br&gt;    ValidateBatchV2(KZG), Signature.Verify(BLS),&lt;br&gt;    AuthenticateGetChunksRequest&lt;br&gt;    ⚠ Relay 응답 데이터 미서명, Relay 서버 미인증&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9933FF&quot;&gt;━ TB3&lt;/font&gt;: Off-chain ↔ On-chain —&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;P8: checkDACert, quorumNumbersRequired, certVersion (CertVerifier, V4)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;P9: getCheckSignaturesIndices(checkDACert 내부)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;EE2: eth_blockNumber / Recency: 오프체인&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;█ TB-D&lt;/font&gt;: Disperser 인프라 — P2/P3/P4/P6/DS1/DS2&lt;br&gt;    P2↔P3 상호 인증 없음 (방화벽 의존, 클라이언트 서명만 전달 검증)&lt;br&gt;    P3↔P4 무검증. DS1/DS2 무결성 미검증. P7/P10은 P3에 통합&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="500" x="2330" y="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leg_flow" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff;strokeColor=#999;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacing=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;데이터 흐름&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#333&#39;&gt;검정(가는)&lt;/font&gt; = Proxy 진입 (무검증 pass-through)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#FF0000&#39;&gt;빨강&lt;/font&gt; = TB1 교차 (Disperser 진입, 실제 검증)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#FF8C00&#39;&gt;주황&lt;/font&gt; = TB2 교차 (Disperser↔Operator)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#9933FF&#39;&gt;보라&lt;/font&gt; = TB3 교차 (Off↔On-chain)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#666666&#39;&gt;회색&lt;/font&gt; = TB-D 내부 (무검증 신뢰)&lt;br&gt;점선 = 응답/폴링" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="360" x="2330" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
