        <mxCell id="leg" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#ccc;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacing=4;" value="&lt;b&gt;Retrieval 순서&lt;/b&gt;: 1*.1 Parse → 1*.2 &lt;font color=&#39;#9933FF&#39;&gt;checkDACert + recency&lt;/font&gt; (BEFORE retrieval) → 1*.2b &lt;font color=&#39;#009900&#39;&gt;Secondary Cache (MultiSourceRead → verify() 호출)&lt;/font&gt; → 1*.3 Relay(+commitment verify+decode) → [fail] → &lt;font color=&#39;#FF8C00&#39;&gt;1*.4 Validator(+commitment verify+decode)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;코드 검증 결과&lt;/b&gt;: 1*.2b secondary cache 경로는 verify() 함수를 전달받아 실행함 (store/secondary/secondary.go:205). 검증 실패 시 skip → 다음 백엔드.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;위협&lt;/b&gt;: Relay GetBlob (1*.3)은 &lt;font color=&#39;#FF0000&#39;&gt;인증 없음&lt;/font&gt; — rate limit만 존재 (relay/server.go:203). GetChunks만 operator 서명 인증.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;순서&lt;/b&gt;: retrievers[] 슬라이스 순차 loop — config/build 단계에서 [relay, validator] 순서 고정" vertex="1">
